{"version":1,"content":"<p>【21：46更新】今日（27日）上午10時許，筲箕灣道318號對開西行線路政署地盤有地底水管爆裂，大量水夾雜沙泥噴出，水花一度射上半空，黃泥水淹蓋行人路及來回行車線，途人及車輛須涉水而行。</p><p>水務署指，至晚上9時半左右，筲箕灣及部分西灣河用戶的食水供應已陸續恢復正常。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:18.983439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:18:08.849410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:18.983439+00:00","content_hash":"063461abf4ae56bda48694965d44d8469948994079a1d99c38038e262b6316d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:18.983439+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-blocked","latest_error":"HTTP 403"},"content_capture":null}